        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, kicking off our work on the new subscription line. I've populated the initial 'Subscription Product Brief and Value Proposition' (A1) based on preliminary research. Please review the target segments and value prop sections. The goal is to finalize these so we can move on to T1 and T2. Feedback welcome. @242297 @270220 @59927 @514149",
