            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Good progress, team. @514149, I agree with your suggestion for the 'Small Business' segment. @270220, good point on the 'Basic' tier, let's add the 'basic reporting' feature to it. @320085, please update A1 with these changes. With that, I'm happy to approve the target segments and core value prop.",
