              514149,
              270220,
              320085
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "Will do. A1 is updated. Now for pricing (T2). I've laid out two models in the doc: a straightforward tiered model and a usage-based model. Given our constraint to reuse existing billing systems, the tiered model is far less complex to implement.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 514149,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Agree. Let's stick with the tiered model for launch to minimize risk. We can explore usage-based pricing in a future iteration. I suggest we model three tiers: Basic at $9/mo, Pro at $29/mo, and Business at $79/mo. This aligns with the value props we just defined.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 59927,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Should we check with finance about the prices?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 270220,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "The price points seem reasonable as a starting point. We'll need to run a margin analysis as part of T2. The $9 entry point feels low enough to attract trial users.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
