            "msg_id": "M12",
            "speaker_id": 242297,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "I agree with the tiered approach and the proposed price bands. Let's move forward with modeling the Basic, Pro, and Business tiers at those price points. This is our selected approach.",
