            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 270220,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've created the first draft of the 'Customer Journey and Experience Blueprint' (A4) and the 'Operational Playbook' (A7). They cover the flow from awareness to cancellation (T4) and the key billing/support processes (T8). Would appreciate your review, especially on the touchpoints and quality checks. @242297 @320085 @514149 @59927",
