          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 514149,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Great work, @270220. Looking at A4, the cancellation flow seems a bit abrupt. To reduce churn, we could add a step to offer a temporary pause or a downgrade to a cheaper plan before final confirmation. This has worked well in the past.",
            "mentions": [
              270220
