        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M57",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, to ensure we can measure success from day one, I've drafted the 'KPI Definitions and Dashboard Spec' (A6). This covers the core metrics for T6. Please review and let me know if you see any gaps. @242297 @514149 @270220 @59927",
