            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M59",
            "speaker_id": 320085,
            "reply_to": "M58",
            "text": "Good question. I've defined it in A6 as (Total Marketing Spend from A2 for the launch period) / (Number of New Subscribers in the same period). I've already synced with a contact in Finance and they confirmed this is the correct approach. I'll add a note to the doc to make that explicit.",
